`src/docugraph/storage/ladybug_driver.py` is derived from graphiti-core 0.30.2's
`graphiti_core/driver/kuzu_driver.py`: it keeps that file's `SCHEMA_QUERIES` and
driver/session structure, and changes three things — it imports `ladybug`
instead of `kuzu`; its `execute_query` passes caller-supplied `None` values
through to the query, where the Kùzu driver drops them; and it loads a verified
full-text-search extension once per database, before the async connection pool
is built.
